{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Root cause recorded in the description (2026-11-21 PST), from the run 44681457334 JUnit tracebacks read against origin/main 863abe7cd19. 4 product defects, 1 of them data-destructive on Windows: compaction recovery stores the snapshot path with a backslash (compact_recovery.py:50) and probes git cat-file -e HEAD:<that path> (:94), so a committed fold reads as absent and is reverted; test_recovery_discards_journal_when_snapshot_is_committed observed recover_abandoned_folds_locked() == 1 on Windows. The other 3 (search_files hits, a code-review error path, two repo scripts) print native paths where a POSIX repo-relative path is the contract. The remaining failures are test-side spelling comparisons; 2 Seatbelt profile tests are macOS-only by subject."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795257798582963001,"uuid":"662521b7-3ac4-4fae-9c22-b2bf2fb8608f"}